      "excerpt": "encyclopedia.parabellumuniverse.com is online — airframes, campaigns, world atlas, and this news feed.",
      "body": "The Parabellum Universe registry is now public. Browse fixed-wing and rotary Airbook entries, campaign dossiers, the Domini world atlas, and lore drops right here.\n\nMore nations, flags, and the 10,000 × 10,000 world map texture are on the way. If you catch a typo in Chihebere's war dates, that's probably intentional. Probably.",
